      {
        "id": "why-two-strategies",
        "moduleId": "link-modes-overview",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "先建立比较框架",
        "markdown": "沿上一节的流水线追问两件事：库指令是在**链接时**写入可执行文件，还是在**运行时**映射进进程？库以什么单位存放、分发与更新？后面的命令和产物都放进这两个维度比较。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "section-framing"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "static-library-and-link",
        "moduleId": "static-link-workflow",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "制作静态库并链接",
        "markdown": "教材把静态库看作特殊的目标文件，先用 `ar rcs lib14-foo-static.a 14-foo1.o 14-foo2.o` 合并目标文件，再链接主程序：\n\n```bash\nld -L. 14-main.o -l14-foo-static -lSystem -L $(xcrun --show-sdk-path -sdk macosx)/usr/lib -o 14-main-static\n```\n\n`-l14-foo-static` 搜索 `lib14-foo-static.a`，`-L.` 把当前目录加入搜索路径。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
