      {
        "id": "entry-trace",
        "moduleId": "startup-and-program-types",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "把启动调用链接起来",
        "markdown": "调用链可写成：`_start` → 准备运行环境 → `main(argc, argv, ...)` → `exit(main 的返回值)`。因此调试动态链接程序时，入口处看到的是 `_start` 而不是 `main`。",
        "provenance": {
